# For STEP_JOBS=4 (four writers, no verify): the load is no longer held near
# 2.3 GB/s by the client's one verifying fio thread, so the budget at which
# a loan keeps up may not be the one the verifying cells found.  256 KiB
# buffer, rings of 4 x 128 then 4 x 64, both storages.  About 70 minutes.
#     STEP_JOBS=4 ./sweep.sh <outdir> plans/16k-6-noverify.plan
128 262144 0 prp step-copy step-copy-n16
128 262144 4 prp step-on step-on-n16
128 262144 2 prp step-on-n16
128 262144 8 prp step-on-n16
128 262144 0 sgl step-copy step-copy-n16
128 262144 4 sgl step-on step-on-n16
128 262144 2 sgl step-on-n16
128 262144 8 sgl step-on-n16
64 262144 0 prp step-copy step-copy-n16
64 262144 4 prp step-on step-on-n16
64 262144 3 prp step-on-n16
64 262144 8 prp step-on-n16
64 262144 0 sgl step-copy step-copy-n16
64 262144 4 sgl step-on step-on-n16
64 262144 3 sgl step-on-n16
64 262144 8 sgl step-on-n16
